flowchart TD
    FRAME["frame budget ~16ms/60Hz (less at 90/120Hz) - miss = jank, >700ms = frozen (Ch 85)"] --> PHASES["compose phases: composition -> layout -> draw"]
    PHASES --> RECOMP{recomposing too much or too expensive}
    RECOMP -->|too much| STABLE["FIX: stable/immutable params -> skippable (ImmutableList, @Immutable, remembered lambda)"]
    RECOMP -->|too much| NARROW["FIX: read state low and late (leaf, lambda defer, derivedStateOf)"]
    RECOMP -->|too expensive| HOIST["FIX: hoist work out of composition, off-main (ViewModel/IO, Ch 3), remember"]
    RECOMP -->|GC jank| ALLOC["FIX: no per-frame allocations (Ch 89)"]
    STABLE --> SMOOTH["every frame within budget = smooth"]
    NARROW --> SMOOTH
    HOIST --> SMOOTH
    ALLOC --> SMOOTH
    LIST["lists: stable keys + light items (Ch 93)"] -.-> RECOMP
    AOT["Baseline Profiles + R8 - AOT render path (Ch 92)"] -.-> FRAME
    MEASURE["measure: Layout Inspector counts + compiler stability + JankStats field (Ch 85) + Macrobenchmark frames (Ch 92)"] -.-> RECOMP
